OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AShakespeare chief threatens to resign
OL,4,Aover Birmingham move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Shakespeare Institute announced on
OL,7,FFacebook on Friday that it had been
OL,8,Finformed it would leave Stratford after
OL,9,Fmore than 75 years. The future of Mason
OL,10,FCroft, along with its historic garden
OL,11,Fand playing fields, has not yet been
OL,12,Fconfirmed.
